Subject: [PATCH 09/10] step7: fuzzy kill-phrase matching (end/in/and/stop +
 conversation, word-order tolerant)

Checked before plugins/custom intents/core intents/classifier/LLM in
ProcessTextAll. Fixes real misses where Vosk transcribed "end" as "in".
